-- COMMAND ----------

-- MAGIC %md
-- MAGIC ### C3. Installation Considerations
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC The installation process prompts for a number of configuration options. Many of these relate to operational aspects, like logging levels and thread settings. However some bigger considerations must be made, which we discuss next.

-- COMMAND ----------

-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC #### C3.1 Group Migration
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC UCX offers a group migration workflow that matches workspace-local groups to existing account-level groups. If an account-level group with the same name exists, it will inherit the permissions that the workspace group. You have the option to review and resolve any name conflicts before migration. 
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC All access grants and ownerships will be replicated and legacy permissions will be cleaned up.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC All migration activities are tracked with dashboards and logs, and outputs are stored in a Delta inventory database for auditing or further analysis. 
